{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a post-apocalyptic dystopia, this Metroidvania combines overwhelming freedom with haunting beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a breathtakingly ruined world and face colossal, eerie creatures that roam its remains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane freedom of interaction.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut and fuse rubble to build rafts. Clone glowing plants to light the darkness. Tear creatures apart and repurpose their bodies as tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the ability to cut, connect, control, clone, blast, and preserve both objects and living creatures, you can interact with the world in ways that defy common sense.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark yet beautiful world</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is a dystopia at the end of the world\u2014its devastated landscapes brought to life with painstakingly detailed visuals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Sound</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic yet unsettling tones and melodies that seem to seep into your body and soul will accompany you throughout your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your purpose is to destroy every organ known as MADO, the source of the light spilling into the world. Little is explained outright\u2014you are left to interpret the world yourself, and to shape it with your own choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is up to you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943840?t=1756378183","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943840?t=1756378183","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943840/0f8299be0fb3ba14f174e8d16bf1c67dd9ae387a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756378183","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943840/0f8299be0fb3ba14f174e8d16bf1c67dd9ae387a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756378183","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a post-apocalyptic dystopia, this Metroidvania combines overwhelming freedom with haunting beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a breathtakingly ruined world and face colossal, eerie creatures that roam its remains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane freedom of interaction.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut and fuse rubble to build rafts. Clone glowing plants to light the darkness. Tear creatures apart and repurpose their bodies as tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the ability to cut, connect, control, clone, blast, and preserve both objects and living creatures, you can interact with the world in ways that defy common sense.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark yet beautiful world</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is a dystopia at the end of the world\u2014its devastated landscapes brought to life with painstakingly detailed visuals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Sound</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic yet unsettling tones and melodies that seem to seep into your body and soul will accompany you throughout your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your purpose is to destroy every organ known as MADO, the source of the light spilling into the world. Little is explained outright\u2014you are left to interpret the world yourself, and to shape it with your own choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is up to you.</p>","developers":["Drainage-GameStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943840/a8351e9d6261eb7b323eda13fe776ab68c7a6b99/header.jpg?t=1756378183","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943840/1738344621/e270a26a25ac1d921f2499309fbf20a25aa299e7/1756307448/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756378181","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943840/1738344621/e270a26a25ac1d921f2499309fbf20a25aa299e7/1756307448/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756378181","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943840/1738344621/e270a26a25ac1d921f2499309fbf20a25aa299e7/1756307448/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756378181","id":257187034,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187034/movie480.mp4?t=1756378181","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187034/movie_max.mp4?t=1756378181"},"name":"MADO Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187034/53a9d2eb9d4b3096cc37f6a5e4eeeb7bc60ad154/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756378181","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187034/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756378181","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187034/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756378181"}}],"name":"MADO","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS: Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or equivalent <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versi